{"seq":2,"slug":"pim-systems","title":"PIM 系统核心","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/pim-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pim-architecture","title":"PIM 平台架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/pim-systems/pim-architecture","wordCount":1536,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-quality-enrichment","title":"数据质量与丰富化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/pim-systems/data-quality-enrichment","wordCount":1489,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-channel-syndication","title":"多渠道内容分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/pim-systems/multi-channel-syndication","wordCount":1444,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"pim-系统核心\">PIM 系统核心</h1><p>PIM 不只是一个「产品数据库」，而是一套围绕商品数据生命周期的完整平台——从数据采集、清洗、丰富到审批发布，每个环节都有明确的架构组件和工作流支撑。本章深入 PIM 系统的三个关键子系统：平台架构设计（数据模型层、工作流引擎、集成层的分层关系）、数据质量与丰富化（完整度评分、AI 辅助补全、验证规则引擎），以及多渠道内容分发（渠道适配、格式转换、推送与拉取模式）。</p>\n<p>理解这三者的协作模式，是设计或选型 PIM 方案时做出正确架构决策的前提。</p>\n"}